38
00:01:34,900 --> 00:01:37,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's hurry and head back
to the curry shop.</font>

39
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:38,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my.</font>

40
00:01:41,030 --> 00:01:43,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That thunder right now...</font>

41
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:45,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">came from the direction
of the Katabami Gold Mine...</font>

42
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:54,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Raiga's</font>

43
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:54,670
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">{[\3c&H000000&\3a&H64&\bord1.818\blur5.455\fs36.364\fad(500,710)\pos(504,469.091)}Counterattack</font>

44
00:02:03,140 --> 00:02:04,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-Boss.</font>

45
00:02:15,780 --> 00:02:17,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">R-Ranmaru!</font>

46
00:02:17,950 --> 00:02:20,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, wake up, Ranmaru!</font>

47
00:02:21,620 --> 00:02:25,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Quit joking around.
I'm not laughing...</font>

48
00:02:26,660 --> 00:02:28,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey... Ranmaru...!</font>

49
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:36,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... What did you do
to Ranmaru?</font>

50
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:39,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No! He...</font>

51
00:02:41,720 --> 00:02:44,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When Ranmaru held your hand...</font>

52
00:02:46,970 --> 00:02:48,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you revived and...</font>

53
00:02:50,140 --> 00:02:52,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then... Ranmaru...</font>

54
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:04,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ranmaru...</font>

55
00:03:19,550 --> 00:03:21,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is Raiga up?!</font>

56
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:24,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must stop him.</font>

57
00:04:03,470 --> 00:04:04,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thunder?</font>

58
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:05,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be?!</font>

59
00:04:08,260 --> 00:04:10,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're slow!</font>

60
00:04:26,070 --> 00:04:29,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you... that brat's comrade...?</font>

61
00:04:59,150 --> 00:05:00,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it's a wooden weapon then...</font>

62
00:05:01,190 --> 00:05:03,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I can't hold it over my head...</font>

63
00:05:34,730 --> 00:05:37,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're annoying!</font>

64
00:05:55,290 --> 00:05:57,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You little fly...!</font>

65
00:05:57,920 --> 00:06:00,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Quit buzzing!</font>

66
00:06:16,770 --> 00:06:19,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm... not smart you know...</font>

67
00:06:20,570 --> 00:06:21,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?</font>

68
00:06:23,320 --> 00:06:27,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know why this happened...</font>

69
00:06:28,110 --> 00:06:32,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, whose fault is it? Yours?!</font>

70
00:06:32,230 --> 00:06:34,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-No! That's not true!</font>

71
00:06:34,620 --> 00:06:37,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps... the guys from the Leaf...</font>

72
00:06:39,080 --> 00:06:41,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh yeah...
If they didn't come</font>

73
00:06:41,670 --> 00:06:44,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then Ranmaru and I would
have been together forever...</font>

74
00:06:45,590 --> 00:06:47,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where are they?!</font>

75
00:06:47,760 --> 00:06:50,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know don't you?!
If you don't know I'll kill you!</font>

76
00:06:50,990 --> 00:06:52,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know...</font>

77
00:06:52,890 --> 00:06:53,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe...!</font>

78
00:07:02,980 --> 00:07:06,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take me... where they are...</font>

79
00:07:06,980 --> 00:07:08,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

80
00:07:08,760 --> 00:07:09,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

81
00:07:12,870 --> 00:07:17,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold on, Ranmaru.
For your funeral...</font>

82
00:07:17,850 --> 00:07:21,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll offer up their corpses for you.</font>

83
00:07:52,450 --> 00:07:53,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ranmaru...</font>

84
00:07:54,450 --> 00:07:58,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This child... Did he give up his life
in order to revive Raiga?</font>

85
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:02,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rai... ga... Rai...</font>

86
00:08:02,290 --> 00:08:04,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ranmaru! You're alive!</font>

87
00:08:05,580 --> 00:08:07,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hang in there! Ranmaru!</font>

88
00:08:07,750 --> 00:08:08,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ranmaru!</font>

89
00:08:50,170 --> 00:08:51,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It started raining.</font>

90
00:08:51,960 --> 00:08:53,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But we're almost done.</font>

91
00:08:57,430 --> 00:09:02,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my, I'm happy that
you all did this much for me.</font>

92
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:04,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no!</font>

93
00:09:04,730 --> 00:09:07,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mom! Something horrible happened!</font>

94
00:09:07,980 --> 00:09:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my... What happened, Karashi?</font>

95
00:09:11,190 --> 00:09:12,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenten is...!</font>

96
00:09:13,500 --> 00:09:15,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened to Tenten?</font>

97
00:09:15,210 --> 00:09:17,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She... fell from a cliff and..</font>

98
00:09:17,450 --> 00:09:18,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

99
00:09:18,370 --> 00:09:19,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?!</font>

100
00:09:19,910 --> 00:09:22,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was running with her and</font>

101
00:09:22,620 --> 00:09:26,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenten said that she would train me
in place of Lee...</font>

102
00:09:26,540 --> 00:09:30,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But there... when we were
approaching the Lightning Pass</font>

103
00:09:30,290 --> 00:09:32,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the lightning struck and
a tree came falling and</font>

104
00:09:32,250 --> 00:09:36,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenten fell from the Pass
to the bottom of the cliff!</font>

105
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:40,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my! Then you must go
help her out immediately!</font>

106
00:09:40,180 --> 00:09:42,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go to help Tenten!</font>

107
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

108
00:09:46,810 --> 00:09:49,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Umm... No I will...</font>

109
00:09:50,400 --> 00:09:54,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will come after you guys
with the first-aid kit.</font>

110
00:09:54,820 --> 00:09:55,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

111
00:09:56,780 --> 00:09:58,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go Naruto, Lee.</font>

112
00:09:58,780 --> 00:10:00,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yes!
— Right!</font>

113
00:10:05,410 --> 00:10:07,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my, Karashi?</font>

114
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:09,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mom, we're running away
from here.</font>

115
00:10:09,330 --> 00:10:11,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying, child?!</font>

116
00:10:11,880 --> 00:10:12,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Never mind that!</font>

117
00:10:13,180 --> 00:10:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll explain it later
so hurry up and get ready.</font>

118
00:10:18,510 --> 00:10:20,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will wait at the Lightning Pass.</font>

119
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:25,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bring them for sure. If not...</font>

120
00:10:27,100 --> 00:10:33,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll offer up you and your mom's corpses
to Ranmaru...</font>

121
00:10:35,070 --> 00:10:37,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mom, please!</font>

122
00:10:37,570 --> 00:10:38,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want to!</font>

123
00:10:39,700 --> 00:10:43,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to wait
until everybody comes back!</font>

124
00:10:43,410 --> 00:10:46,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mom! You are so stubborn!</font>

125
00:10:46,790 --> 00:10:47,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just come with me!</font>

126
00:10:55,090 --> 00:10:56,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you think that Tenten would
fall off a cliff</font>

127
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:58,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">merely because of the thunder?</font>

128
00:10:58,920 --> 00:11:00,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What do you mean?</font>

129
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:03,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Karashi...
It seems like he wasn't trained enough.</font>

130
00:11:04,140 --> 00:11:05,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry...</font>

131
00:11:05,970 --> 00:11:06,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then...</font>

132
00:11:07,020 --> 00:11:09,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps... it's some kind
of trap again.</font>

133
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:11,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or he's been threatened
by someone...</font>

134
00:11:12,650 --> 00:11:14,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the Kurosuki Family is...!</font>

135
00:11:15,100 --> 00:11:16,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe my eyes were cloudy...</font>

136
00:11:16,610 --> 00:11:17,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

137
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:19,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's him...</font>

138
00:11:33,330 --> 00:11:34,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's burning up with fever...</font>

139
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:38,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raiga...?</font>

140
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:44,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He revived so you should too...</font>

141
00:11:45,550 --> 00:11:49,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all right. I'm going to die
soon anyway.</font>

142
00:11:50,350 --> 00:11:53,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way! I'm not going to let you say
that you're going to die so easily!</font>

143
00:11:54,400 --> 00:11:59,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The people who were killed by you
and Raiga died against their will!</font>

144
00:12:02,030 --> 00:12:04,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not going to let it go your way!</font>

145
00:12:04,780 --> 00:12:07,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the sake of those
whose freedoms you took away.</font>

146
00:12:07,580 --> 00:12:09,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to have you
take responsibility!</font>

147
00:12:13,540 --> 00:12:14,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay?</font>

148
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:20,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The storm... It'll be dangerous
to stay here...</font>

149
00:12:21,670 --> 00:12:22,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To Grandma's place.</font>

150
00:12:30,680 --> 00:12:32,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've come!</font>

151
00:12:33,940 --> 00:12:34,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raiga!</font>

152
00:12:34,850 --> 00:12:36,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So he is alive.</font>

153
00:12:37,020 --> 00:12:40,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time I'll take you down for sure!</font>

154
00:12:40,190 --> 00:12:41,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

155
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:52,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not good! Lee!</font>

156
00:12:58,250 --> 00:12:59,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you...?</font>

157
00:13:05,220 --> 00:13:06,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this?</font>

158
00:13:06,880 --> 00:13:08,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's on a whole different level
from before...!</font>

159
00:13:14,640 --> 00:13:19,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Probably that attack was
lightning made of Chakra.</font>

160
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:20,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But this one...</font>

161
00:13:21,110 --> 00:13:23,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Real lightning is used as the source...</font>

162
00:13:25,860 --> 00:13:30,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If he can utilize the power of nature
unlike Chakra he'll have no limits!</font>

163
00:13:35,160 --> 00:13:36,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get down!</font>

164
00:13:41,750 --> 00:13:42,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

165
00:13:47,590 --> 00:13:49,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we dodge through
the electric shock and</font>

166
00:13:49,430 --> 00:13:50,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">take this to a close-range battle...</font>

167
00:13:51,060 --> 00:13:51,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

168
00:13:52,180 --> 00:13:53,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know it!</font>

169
00:13:57,850 --> 00:13:59,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

170
00:14:06,530 --> 00:14:07,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

171
00:14:20,210 --> 00:14:21,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

172
00:14:22,090 --> 00:14:23,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

173
00:14:23,750 --> 00:14:25,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

174
00:14:26,630 --> 00:14:28,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

175
00:14:28,430 --> 00:14:29,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

176
00:14:30,340 --> 00:14:31,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

177
00:14:36,060 --> 00:14:37,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good job, Naruto!</font>

178
00:14:39,020 --> 00:14:39,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gentle Fist!</font>

179
00:14:44,190 --> 00:14:45,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji!</font>

180
00:14:54,030 --> 00:14:57,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You brats! Is that all you know?</font>

181
00:14:58,080 --> 00:15:01,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unlike the natural thunder power
I'm using</font>

182
00:15:01,750 --> 00:15:04,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chakra has its limits!</font>

183
00:15:07,010 --> 00:15:07,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?</font>

184
00:15:09,550 --> 00:15:12,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're an idiot!
There's an idiot here!</font>

185
00:15:12,180 --> 00:15:16,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that what you say to an opponent
who fought with all his power?!</font>

186
00:15:16,810 --> 00:15:17,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

187
00:15:19,640 --> 00:15:21,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You again...</font>

188
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:23,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time I'm not going to
have a funeral for you!</font>

189
00:15:42,790 --> 00:15:44,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am angry.</font>

190
00:15:57,100 --> 00:15:59,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my, what are you doing?!</font>

191
00:15:59,270 --> 00:16:02,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please Mom, come with me!</font>

192
00:16:02,310 --> 00:16:03,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no time.</font>

193
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:05,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, I'm going to stay here!</font>

194
00:16:06,440 --> 00:16:07,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Tenten!</font>

195
00:16:12,030 --> 00:16:14,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my! This stupid son of mine!</font>

196
00:16:15,880 --> 00:16:19,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I couldn't help it
because the boss came back to life...</font>

197
00:16:19,750 --> 00:16:21,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we stay here
we're going to get killed.</font>

198
00:16:21,750 --> 00:16:23,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The only choice we have
is to run away!</font>

199
00:16:23,460 --> 00:16:25,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you want to run away
then go.</font>

200
00:16:26,960 --> 00:16:28,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not running away.</font>

201
00:16:28,500 --> 00:16:31,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not going to give up,
I will save this child.</font>

202
00:16:37,680 --> 00:16:41,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will feed this boy
the curry of life!</font>

203
00:16:41,350 --> 00:16:42,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma...</font>

204
00:16:42,800 --> 00:16:45,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the curry that revived Lee.</font>

205
00:16:47,520 --> 00:16:48,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

206
00:16:53,450 --> 00:16:55,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If anything happens
it's not my fault!</font>

207
00:17:03,790 --> 00:17:05,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

208
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:08,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One, two...</font>

209
00:17:09,040 --> 00:17:10,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One, two...</font>

210
00:17:10,590 --> 00:17:12,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One, two... One, two...</font>

211
00:17:13,170 --> 00:17:15,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One, two... One, two...</font>

212
00:17:16,430 --> 00:17:17,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad...</font>

213
00:17:17,890 --> 00:17:18,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is really bad!</font>

214
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:17,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eat this... you'll feel better.</font>

215
00:18:21,580 --> 00:18:22,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please.</font>

216
00:18:26,710 --> 00:18:28,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You messed up on
mixing the spices.</font>

217
00:18:29,120 --> 00:18:30,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my?!</font>

218
00:18:39,550 --> 00:18:45,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Karashi, could you have memorized
my recipe of the curry of life?</font>

219
00:18:50,270 --> 00:18:51,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Karashi...</font>

220
00:18:56,940 --> 00:19:00,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the true curry of life.</font>

221
00:19:05,490 --> 00:19:06,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here please eat this.</font>

222
00:19:10,250 --> 00:19:13,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't even eat
if you're not with Raiga?</font>

223
00:19:14,920 --> 00:19:15,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?</font>

224
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:18,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why... for a person like me?</font>

225
00:19:19,090 --> 00:19:21,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does one need a reason
to save someone?</font>

226
00:19:22,390 --> 00:19:23,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To save you</font>

227
00:19:23,970 --> 00:19:28,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Sansho and Karashi
did their best to make the curry.</font>

228
00:19:28,890 --> 00:19:32,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you feel anything seeing
those two trying their best?</font>

229
00:19:32,900 --> 00:19:36,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't feel anything
you're a horrible human being!</font>

230
00:19:38,610 --> 00:19:42,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Human beings support each other
in order to live...</font>

231
00:19:42,820 --> 00:19:45,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If there are people who need help
don't others naturally lend them a hand?</font>

232
00:19:45,620 --> 00:19:46,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't that being human?</font>

233
00:19:52,710 --> 00:19:55,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, one bite is fine.
Why don't you try it?</font>

234
00:20:10,640 --> 00:20:11,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was it good?</font>

235
00:20:13,150 --> 00:20:15,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is what it feels like to live.</font>

236
00:20:22,450 --> 00:20:23,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raiga...</font>

237
00:20:24,280 --> 00:20:26,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want him to eat this curry too.</font>

238
00:20:29,330 --> 00:20:30,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go.</font>

239
00:20:54,310 --> 00:20:55,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm far from finished...!</font>

240
00:20:57,440 --> 00:21:00,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy...
What is up with him?</font>

241
00:21:20,380 --> 00:21:32,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>dokomademo tsudzuku michi ni wa ironna koto arunda ne</b></font></font></font></font>

242
00:21:20,380 --> 00:21:32,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>so many things happen on this endless road, right?</b></font></font></font></font>

243
00:21:32,030 --> 00:21:43,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>tsuyogari na kimi ga kyou wa juwaki koshi ni namida koe</b></font></font></font></font>

244
00:21:32,030 --> 00:21:43,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>although you're strong-willed your voice wavered on the phone today</b></font></font></font></font>

245
00:21:43,630 --> 00:21:54,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>donna yume oikakete kokomade kitan darou</b></font></font></font></font>

246
00:21:43,630 --> 00:21:54,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>what dreams did you chase to get here?</b></font></font></font></font>

247
00:21:54,420 --> 00:22:06,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>wakara na kunattari suru koto wa boku ni datte aru kara nee BABY</b></font></font></font></font>

248
00:21:54,420 --> 00:22:06,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even I have times when I just don't understand baby</b></font></font></font></font>

249
00:22:06,760 --> 00:22:18,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>kimi ga namida no toki ni wa boku ga soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

250
00:22:06,760 --> 00:22:18,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>when you're sad I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

251
00:22:18,280 --> 00:22:29,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>hanareba nare no yoru datte boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

252
00:22:18,280 --> 00:22:29,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even on nights when we're apart I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

253
00:22:29,880 --> 00:22:35,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

254
00:22:29,880 --> 00:22:35,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

255
00:22:40,770 --> 00:22:45,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Damn it! What in the world
happened to my body?!</font>

256
00:22:45,400 --> 00:22:49,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">It is pitch black in front of me,
my entire body is numb</font>

257
00:22:49,410 --> 00:22:51,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">and my body doesn't do
what I want it to do.</font>

258
00:22:52,870 --> 00:22:54,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What is this feeling...?</font>

259
00:22:55,330 --> 00:22:58,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">It's warm, my entire body
is burning</font>

260
00:22:58,580 --> 00:23:02,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">and what is this taste that brings energy
up from the bottom of my stomach...?</font>

261
00:23:03,340 --> 00:23:05,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Run!!! The Curry of Life."</font>

